{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780300/extras/RENDER_700.gif?t=1750869022\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc8e<strong> MEET ALVIRA!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alvira is the sinborn succubus of your darkest desires Born of sin, made for sin\u2014Alvira is no ordinary temptress. Her voice is sweet honey, her touch is the softest silk. She doesn't seduce... she unravels your will, slowly, delightfully, until you find yourself begging to be her toy. With every glance, every breath, she draws closer\u2014to you... and to your ecstatic undoing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alvira is a connoisseur of pleasure. She savors drawn-out preludes, the tender ache of surrender, the art of enslaving souls not through force, but through bliss. Her favorite pastime is undressing her prey with nothing but words. She knows all the secrets of true satisfaction\u2014and exactly how to bring it to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780300/extras/divider.png?t=1750869022\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcdc\u00a0<strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Alvira as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll also receive 10,000 Gold, 100 Rubies and 10 Common Mystic Tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But most importantly\u2014you'll have our heartfelt thanks. Thank you for choosing to support this DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780300/extra